"Air Force One, Zero Mile Tower, runway 27R, cleared to land. Welcome to India.": "voice/clips/8fc8d2ea5cdc.mp3",
"SAM 29000, the spare, runway 27C, cleared to land.": "voice/clips/aa6625b585bb.mp3",
"We now take 27L as well.": "voice/clips/edc9145e582f.mp3",
"The spare aircraft needs a spare runway.": "voice/clips/2c85657dd48f.mp3",
"Ladies and gentlemen. Three Presidents shall now be landing at the same time, on three runways. Nobody will be first.": "voice/clips/d431f671ccb8.mp3",
"Air China One, runway 27R.": "voice/clips/2c038d472922.mp3",
"Russia, runway 27C.": "voice/clips/b37826269b75.mp3",
"Air Force One, runway 27L.": "voice/clips/06bcd01e21bb.mp3",
"Air China One, Russia, Air Force One: all three cleared to land. Together.": "voice/clips/a204ad144528.mp3",
"Aussie One, 27C. G'day. Long way for a photo.": "voice/clips/99da1101dbcf.mp3",
"Attention, please. The cars of the Russian Federation. Then the second aircraft. Also identical.": "voice/clips/cf8cdd0902b6.mp3",
"Russia Two, also Ilyushin, also established, 27R.": "voice/clips/25bf68b204d5.mp3",
"Ladies and gentlemen. The spare aircraft of the President of the United States.": "voice/clips/e4787ee6b004.mp3",
